Data attribution notice
-----------------------

This application repackages public reference data for field use:

- The Department of Agricultural Extension (DAE) pesticide register and the
  Pesticide Technical Advisory Committee (PTAC) gazettes of Bangladesh,
  retrieved via the Plant Protection Wing API (ppw.krishi.gov.bd).
- The IRAC Mode of Action classification, the FRAC classification, and the
  HRAC classification of herbicides.

Those classifications and registers belong to their respective publishers.
The MIT License above covers this repository's code and documentation; it
does not relicense third-party data or the official PDF references shipped
in public/downloads/.
